{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Capstone 12 \u2014 Video Understanding Pipeline (Scene, QA, Search) Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "1. **Ingest walker.** Accept YouTube URLs or local MP4s. Downscale to 720p if needed. Persist `{video_id, file_path}`."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "2. **Scene segmentation.** Run TransNetV2 or PySceneDetect to produce `[{scene_id, start_ms, end_ms, keyframe_path}]`. Target 100 hours: ~6k-8k scenes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "3. **ASR pass.** Run Whisper-v3-turbo on audio; export word-level timestamps; split into per-scene transcript slices."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "4. **VLM captioning.** Per scene, call Gemini 2.5 Pro (or Qwen3-VL-Max) with the keyframe and a short caption template. Produce caption + frame embedding."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "5. **Multi-vector index.** Qdrant collection with three named vectors. Payload: `{video_id, scene_id, start_ms, end_ms, keyframe_url}`."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "6. **Query.** Natural-language question fires three dense queries; merge with reciprocal rank fusion; top-k=5 scenes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "7. **Temporal grounding.** Run TimeLens-style adapter on the top scene to refine the (start, end) window within the scene."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "8. **VLM synth.** Call Gemini 2.5 Pro with query + top-3 scene clips (as images or short clips) + transcripts. Require `(video_id, start_ms, end_ms)` citations."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "9. **Eval.** Run ActivityNet-QA and NeXT-GQA. Build a 100-query custom set. Report overall accuracy + per-class breakdown (counting, action, descriptive)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. Swap Gemini 2.5 Pro for Qwen3-VL-Max on the captioning pass. Report caption quality delta on a human-rated 50-scene sample.\n\n2. Reduce per-scene frame embedding to one pooled vector instead of multi-vector. Measure the retrieval regression.\n\n3. Build a \"counting strict\" mode: the synthesizer extracts each counted instance with a timestamp and the user clicks to verify. Measure whether user-verification reduces hallucination.\n\n4. Benchmark ingest cost: hours-of-video-per-dollar across three VLM choices. Pick the sweet spot.\n\n5. Add speaker-diarized transcript: run pyannote speaker diarization on the audio and embed per-speaker transcripts. Demonstrate \"what did Alice say about X?\" queries."
      ]
    }
  ],
